# Build context is the repo root. The hub image needs services/hub (for the
# `hub` binary) and apps/desktop (for the /app web build) and nothing else.
#
# Note this is a WIDER context than the node's, because of the web build alone.
# apps/desktop is large, so the exclusions below are load-bearing for build time
# rather than tidiness — and node_modules is excluded because the build runs its
# own `npm ci`, which must resolve from package-lock.json rather than inherit
# whatever a developer's tree happens to hold.
*
!services/hub
!apps/desktop
!deploy/fly/hub
# Shared with the node base image; see the note in its .dockerignore.
!deploy/fly/fetch-release.sh
!deploy/fly/write-build-stamp.sh

services/hub/hub
services/hub/brain
services/hub/mcp
services/hub/workspacer
services/hub/claudemon
services/hub/web

apps/desktop/dist
apps/desktop/release
apps/desktop/out
apps/desktop/test-results
apps/desktop/playwright-report

**/.git
**/node_modules
**/*.log
